Discovery is complete. The fixes are now scoped to the staged runtime sources, not the live host:  
- menu wrappers will reserve a non-cancel status for wrapper failures and stop swallowing it in Digital Assets/ADB;  
- the Digital Assets catalog will no longer load the action runtime;  
- AppArmor will own a typed default command runner;  
- display launch will use a Wayland/GTK wrapper, with profile, staging, and validation kept in sync.

